> theta <- extractMatrix(chp, returnUgcMap=TRUE);
> ugcMap <- attr(theta, "unitGroupCellMap");
> un<-getUnitNames(cdf_1, ugcMap[,"unit"]);
> rownames(theta) <- un

Jay,

I think what you want here is (or, as you discovered below, the group
name):

un<-getUnitNames(cdf_1)
rownames(theta)<-un

... write.table ...

Alternatively, it would probably be cleaner (easier to read and less
prone to manual error) if you used:
theta<-extractDataFrame(chp,addNames=TRUE)

Cheers,
Mark

