Jay,

These are likely probesets that are controls.  But, really, I don't
know.  The probeset that contains the 2527 probes is definitely a set
of controls and you are probably not interested in that anyways.

I am just in the process of creating a set of CDF files for the MoEx
array, similar to what Elizabeth created for the HuEx array:
http://groups.google.com/group/aroma-affymetrix/web/affymetrix-defined-transcript-clusters

So far, I only have the 'core' version, which you can get from:
http://bioinf.wehi.edu.au/folders/mrobinson/exon/mouse_cdfs/

You can use it, as described at (i.e. using the 'tags=' argument ...):
http://groups.google.com/group/aroma-affymetrix/web/human-exon-array-analysis

Are you needing the 'core+extended' and 'core+full+extended'
versions?  I'll get those started so that we have a complete set
ready.  Hopefully later this week.

Cheers,
Mark

